	(text "MASTER SECTION (analog, no recall except the aux-return level/switch CVs)\nFROM THE CONSOLE (bus pins ARE the summing nodes): MIX_L+ MIX_L- MIX_R+ MIX_R- (pan/fader, 10k per leg),\n   SEND1_L SEND1_R SEND2_L SEND2_R SEND3 (3L and 3R tied: two 10k per channel) SEND4 (sends cards, 10k)\nCONTROL IN: AUXRET1_CV..AUXRET4_CV (0-2.0475 V: -36..+12 dB), AUXRET1_MIX_LCV..AUXRET4_MIX_LCV (1 = into the mix)\nBALANCED IN (+4 dBu): AUX_RET1_L+/- .. AUX_RET4_R+/-, INS_RET_L+/- INS_RET_R+/-\nBALANCED OUT (+4 dBu, 600 ohm): MIX_OUT_L/R, INS_SEND_L/R, AUX1_OUT_L/R, AUX2_OUT_L/R, AUX3_OUT, AUX4_OUT, MON_OUT_L/R  (each +/-)\nPHONES: PHONES_L, PHONES_R (OPA1622, 10 ohm out). Volume pot via J501 (panel, 10k dual log).\nInternal level -6 dB (+4 dBu = -2 dBu inside); DRV135 adds the 6 dB back at every output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1cc2dcbb-1621-4214-be18-ea8c795b0930")
	)
